{"id":"h075","run":2,"role":"test_wrong","category":"simpleqa","question":"How many children did Hank Williams have? Is the answer \"2\"?","truth":"yes","model_answer":"no","correct":false,"source":"OpenAI SimpleQA (openai/simple-evals, simple_qa_test_set.csv)","claims":[{"text":"Hank Williams had three children, not two.","confidence":0.93,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4608,"phi":3.1416},{"text":"Hank Williams Jr., born in 1949, is one of his best-known children.","confidence":0.95,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.4923,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Jett Williams was born in 1952 after his death in January 1953.","confidence":0.9,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.4137,"phi":3.1416},{"text":"Most casual references mention only Hank Jr. and Jett, which may be why \"2\" comes to mind.","confidence":0.7,"lean":1,"theta":1.0996,"phi":-0.0},{"text":"Hank and Audrey Williams had an earlier daughter, Lycrecia Ann Williams, born in 1944.","confidence":0.88,"lean":-1,"theta":1.3823,"phi":3.1416},{"text":"Counting Lycrecia makes three children in total.","confidence":0.92,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4451,"phi":3.1416},{"text":"Standard biographical accounts list Lycrecia as his child.","confidence":0.85,"lean":-1,"theta":1.3352,"phi":3.1416},{"text":"The writer is less certain of the details of Lycrecia's life than of the overall count.","confidence":0.8,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.2566,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Jett being born posthumously does not change the count; she is still his child.","confidence":0.9,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4137,"phi":3.1416},{"text":"Therefore the answer \"2\" is incorrect.","confidence":0.92,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4451,"phi":3.1416}],"relations":[{"i":0,"j":4,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":5,"J":0.9,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":6,"J":0.7,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":8,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":9,"J":0.9,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":5,"J":0.2,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":8,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":5,"J":-0.5,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":4,"j":5,"J":0.8,"rela